    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brought to the market by Bryan Little of REMAX Partners a substantial, well-presented three-bedroom house with the added benefit of a converted attic. 236 Beech Park is presented in a contemporary style throughout and features a lovely kitchen/dining/living area at the rear of the property, overlooking the south-facing garden.  Well located in the newest phase of Beech Park, the M4 is a few minutes’ drive away, public transport links are close by, and Louisa Bridge Train Station is a 15-minute walk away.  \r\nSome of the key features include.\r\nGreat living space with a well-proportioned living room to the front of the property, and a large open-plan high-end kitchen/dining/living space at the rear.\r\nA utility room and guest WC complete downstairs\r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms two doubles and a single with the master ensuite and a family bathroom.\r\nAt the bottom of the south-facing rear garden, there is a well-kitted-out granny flat/studio apartment which presents a myriad of opportunities. \r\n\r\n\r\nThis is a great spacious property in good order and in an excellent location – definitely worth viewing!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nHALLWAY: c.6.21 x 1.24 m\r\nRecessed lighting, tiled floor, phone point\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM: c.4.26 x 3.51 m\r\nCentre rose,  light fitting, feature fireplace, curtains, blinds, wooden floor, TV point, cable TV, \r\n\r\nKITCHEN: c.5.44 x 4.84 m\r\nCoving, centre rose, light fittings, fitted units, tiled splash back area, stainless steel sink, area plumbed, island unit, breakfast bar, French double doors leading to garden / patio area, ceramic tiles TV /phone point, blinds\r\n\r\nUTILITY ROOM: c. 2.47 x 1.63 m\r\nLight fittings, fitted units, area fully plumbed, tiled floor\r\n\r\nGUEST WC: c. 1.45 x 1.47 m\r\nLight fitting, WC. WHB. Shelving, wall tiles, floor tiles\r\n\r\nLANDING: c. 3.95 x 1.01 m\r\nLight fitting, hot-press, attic access, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1: c. 4.32 x 2.79 m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, window, blind, wooden floor\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c. 1.50 x 1.57 m\r\nLight fitting, floor & wall tiling, shower cubicle, shower with rainforest head, WC, WHB\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2:  c. 4.32 x 2.77 m\r\nLight fittings, fitted wardrobes, window, blind, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3: c. 3.21 x 2.00 m\r\nLight fitting, fitted wardrobes, window, blind, wooden floor\r\n\r\nBATHROOM; c. 1.68 x 2.02 m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, wall tiling, floor tiling, WC, WHB, shower\r\n\r\nLANDING: c.1.18 x 1.03 m\r\nLight fitting\r\n\r\nATTIC ROOM: c.5.65 x 3.88 m\r\nRecessed lighting, fitted wardrobes, storage area, Velux windows, wooden floors\r\n\r\nENSUITE: c.2.10 x 1.43 m\r\nLight fitting, extractor fan, floor & wall tiling, shower cubicle with mains shower, WC,WHB,heated towel rail\r\n\r\nSTUDIO APARTMENT c.3.37 x 3.64m\r\nOpen plan living/ kitchen / bedroom, recessed lighting, blinds, wooden floor, TV point, cable TV, door leading to the garden, \r\n\r\nEnsuite bathroom c.1.13 x 2.00 m"
